# Two white rowboats (issue 076, from one of Marc's unhung pieces, brightened from an underexposed photo): a weathered grey frame, light and mid blue water with pale gold glints at the top, a smaller boat behind and a long one in front seen from above, white hulls with brown rims and dark insides, dark blue reflections under them. 32x16 wall slot, the frame centred.
size: 32x16
